                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37483330-f788-4c65-81bc-ef401da63d36",
                                                "sense_id": "9237be69-7e1e-3d64-bab4-9704e31fd1c9",
                                                "text": "Nearly 200 chemicals connected to breast cancer are used in the making of food packaging and plastic tableware, and dozens of those carcinogens can migrate into the human body, a new study found."
